<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Reset Successful</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f1f5f9; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">

```
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="padding: 40px 15px;">
    <tr>
        <td align="center">

            <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                style="max-width: 500px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px;"
            >

                <!-- Header -->
                <tr>
                    <td
                        style="background-color: #0f172a; padding: 20px; text-align: center;"
                    >
                        <h2 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff;">
                            Parcel<span style="color: #ea580c;">Pilot</span>
                        </h2>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Content -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 35px 30px;">

                        <h1 style="margin: 0 0 15px; color: #0f172a; font-size: 24px;">
                            Password Reset Successful
                        </h1>

                        <p style="color: #334155; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px;">
                            Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,
                        </p>

                        <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px;">
                            Your ParcelPilot account password has been successfully reset.
                        </p>

                        <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px;">
                            You can now log in using your new password.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top: 25px; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">
                            If you did not make this change, please contact ParcelPilot support immediately.
                        </p>

                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Footer -->
                <tr>
                    <td
                        style="background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 18px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"
                    >
                        <p style="margin: 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px;">
                            &copy; ParcelPilot. All rights reserved.
                        </p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

            </table>

        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
```

</body>
</html>
